  "kodi_libraries": "Kodi 21.3 on the box (Debian package 3:21.3+dfsg-1+rpt3) links the system libfreetype.so.6 (libfreetype6 2.13.3+dfsg-1+deb13u1) and libharfbuzz.so.0 (libharfbuzz0b 10.2.0-1+deb13u1): the libraries the tool ran with",
